<PortfolioLayout title="Kenny Ponders" lang="zh" page="index">
<main id="main" data-screen-label="首页 · 可靠交付">
<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">KENNY WU · AI ENGINEER · SHENZHEN</p><h1>从 AI 原型，<br>到<span class="blue">可靠交付。</span></h1><p class="lead">我是 Kenny，一名 AI 应用与系统工程师。<br>聚焦语言模型、信息检索与多模态，把模型真正用进实际业务里。</p><div class="links"><a class="primary" href="mailto:jdlow@live.cn">聊聊你的项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#delivery">看看交付案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><aside class="hero-aside"><ResponsiveImage src="/assets/img/practices/walk.png" alt="散步中的 Kenny 插画" sizes="148px" loading="eager" desktopOnly /><p>从学术研究走向工程落地，<br>也留点时间琢磨深层问题。</p><a href="/zh/about/">关于我 ↗</a></aside></section>
<section class="delivery" id="delivery" aria-labelledby="delivery-title"><div class="section-head"><p class="label">01 / SELECTED DELIVERY</p><span class="caption">工作案例 · 职责与成果</span></div><div class="case-grid"><div class="case-copy"><p class="case-role"><time datetime="2026">2026</time> · 项目技术侧负责人</p><h2 id="delivery-title">AI 漫剧生成系统</h2><p class="case-thesis">光能生成还不够，<br>关键在能质检、能自动恢复。</p><p>串联剧本理解、角色资产提取与分镜生成，并主导质量评测与自动化验收机制。</p><a href="/zh/about/#experience" class="text-link">看职责与完整成果 ↗</a></div><div class="case-evidence"><div class="workflow"><div class="figure-head"><span class="label">从剧本到可验收的分镜</span><span class="caption">流程示意</span></div><ol class="flow"><li><span>01 / UNDERSTAND</span><strong>剧本理解</strong><small>拆清角色与情节</small></li><li><span>02 / ORGANIZE</span><strong>资产解析</strong><small>组织角色与场景</small></li><li><span>03 / GENERATE</span><strong>分镜生成</strong><small>结构化、多镜分解</small></li></ol><div class="quality-loop"><strong>自动质量打分</strong><span>→</span><strong>限制重试成本</strong><span>→</span><strong>验收交付</strong></div><p class="recovery">稳定性保障：熔断 · 并发控制 · 断点自愈</p></div><div class="proof"><div><p class="proof-label">固定评测集 · 问题率</p><p class="big-number"><span class="before">≈18%</span><span class="metric-arrow">→</span>9.53%</p><p class="caption">动作过载与景别失当 · 相对降幅约 47%</p></div><div><p class="proof-label">一次真实运行</p><p class="big-number">20 <small>集</small></p><p class="caption">遇中间报错自动恢复，完整跑完</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="support-case" aria-labelledby="rag-title"><div><p class="label">2024 / RETRIEVAL & ANSWERING</p><h2 id="rag-title">企业文档问答</h2><p>结合段落树切分与多路混合检索，解决长文档问答中的“查不准”与“答非所问”。</p><a class="text-link" href="/zh/about/#enterprise">看这段经历 ↗</a></div><div class="rag-flow" aria-label="文档、检索、回答的流程示意"><span>文档结构</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>多路检索</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>回答评估</span></div><div class="rag-result"><strong>≈90%</strong><p>内部测试<br>召回率与问答准确率</p></div></section>
<section class="judgments" aria-labelledby="judgment-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">02 / ENGINEERING JUDGMENT</p><h2 id="judgment-title">我的工程思考与做事原则</h2></div><a href="/zh/about/#questions">反复思考的问题 ↗</a></div><div class="judgment-grid"><article><span class="number">01</span><h3>动手前，先定好验收标准。</h3><p>不要凭感觉调优。把质量要求量化为指标，用固定的评测集验证每次修改到底有没有变好。</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h3>把故障当成常态来设计。</h3><p>大模型调用难免偶发失败。做好断点恢复与重试上限，别让单个环节的报错拖崩整条长链路。</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h3>不只看单次生成，看全链路闭环。</h3><p>从数据过滤、并发调度到降级兜底，把前后配套做扎实，才谈得上真正交付可用。</p></article></div></section>
<section class="open-work" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="label">03 / OPEN-SOURCE WORK</p><h2 id="work-title">把想法，做成日常顺手的工具。</h2></div><a href="/zh/projects/">全部项目 ↗</a></div><div class="work-grid"><a class="work-feature" href="/zh/projects/#videowipe"><figure><ResponsiveImage src="/assets/portfolio/focus/videowipe.jpg" alt="VideoWipe 的视频清理工作台真实截图" sizes="(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 68px), (max-width: 1168px) 58vw, 626px"  /><figcaption>真实界面 / VideoWipe</figcaption></figure><div class="work-title"><h3>VideoWipe</h3><span>↗</span></div><p>精准擦除视频字幕与水印，每一步处理都清晰可见。</p></a><div class="work-side"><a href="/zh/projects/#script-weaver"><span class="label">SCREENPLAY · STORYBOARD</span><h3>Script-Weaver ↗</h3><p>从一个故事点子，生成结构化剧本、分镜与 AI 视频提示词。</p></a><a href="/zh/projects/#obsidian-kami"><span class="label">READING · WRITING</span><h3>Kami Reader ↗</h3><p>给知识工作一个安静、顺手的阅读空间。</p></a><a href="/zh/projects/#tracework"><span class="label">CONTEXT · DECISIONS</span><h3>Tracework ↗</h3><p>记录 Agent 协作时的关键决策与上下文，让每一次改动有迹可循。</p></a></div></div></section>
